    <briefdescription>
<para>RP2040 USB HID gateway library for <ref refid="namespaceOpenSkyhawk" kindref="compound">OpenSkyhawk</ref> <ref refid="namespaceSimGateway" kindref="compound">SimGateway</ref> board. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Owns the USB CDC ↔ UART relay, 0xAA 0x55 HID frame demultiplexer, and HID report batching. HIDAxis, HIDButton, and HIDHatSwitch objects are declared in the sketch at file scope and self-register into linked lists at construction. <ref refid="namespaceSimGateway_1aa8f7b2f81634cf26fff1d4d03b3ec70b" kindref="member">SimGateway::loop()</ref> walks those lists and dispatches matching HID frames into the USB HID report.</para>
<para>Does NOT run DCS-BIOS or parse DCS-BIOS addresses. The relay knows no CAN; the uploader (<ref refid="Uploader_8h" kindref="compound">Uploader.h</ref>, #366/#367) drives board bootloaders over CAN through <ref refid="namespacePanelBridge" kindref="compound">PanelBridge</ref>. Platform: RP2040 only.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="copyright"><para>GPL-2.0-only — see Firmware/LICENSE </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
